### Crear recurso (temporalmente sin auth hasta ISS-13)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@id = 1

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/recursos
Content-Type: application/json

{ "method": "GET", "path": "/api/reportes", "description": "Listar reportes" }

### Reemplazar recurso
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/recursos/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "method": "GET", "path": "/api/reportes", "description": "Reporte" }

### Eliminar lógico
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/recursos/{{id}}/deactivate

### Eliminar físico
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/recursos/{{id}}